Package: fabos-tuning
Version: @DISTRO_VERSION@-@PKG_REVISION@
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: @VENDOR_NAME@ <support@patienceai.in>
Homepage: @HOME_URL@
Depends: systemd, udev, polkitd, power-profiles-daemon, libkf6config-bin, qdbus-qt6, libkscreen-bin
Description: @DISTRO_NAME@ performance modes and system tuning (power, gaming, server)
 The Performance mode of @DISTRO_NAME@ (quick settings > battery card, or
 `fabos-perf-mode set MODE`): Power saver, Balanced, Performance, Gaming and
 Server, each mapped to settings that can be read back — the
 power-profiles-daemon profile, KWin tearing / variable refresh / effects,
 PowerDevil display and sleep behaviour, the "Hey Fab" listener's duty, and
 (through a one-shot root helper a logged-in user may start without a
 password) the CPU frequency governor. The mode persists across reboots.
 Also ships the I/O scheduler defaults per device class (udev) and a shorter
 stop timeout for user services. Documented in docs/PERFORMANCE.md.
